@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor Student
package "Student browser" {
  component "Moodle page" as Page
  component "Embedded launcher\nweb/embed.js" as Bubble
  component "Chat panel\nweb/chat.html" as Chat
}
package "Agent host (Python)" {
  component "FastAPI endpoint\nserver.py /api/chat" as API
  component "Agent orchestrator\nagent.py" as Agent
  component "7 read-only tools" as Tools
  component "LMS adapter\nlms.py (MoodleLMS / MockLMS)" as Adapter
}
package "Moodle Docker" {
  component "Moodle 5.3\nREST web services" as Moodle
}
database "PostgreSQL\nDocker" as DB
cloud "Anthropic Claude API\nexternal trust boundary" as Claude
Student --> Page
Page --> Bubble : injected script
Bubble --> Chat : opens iframe
Chat --> API : HTTP POST /api/chat
API --> Agent : ask(question)
Agent --> Claude : HTTPS prompt + tool context
Claude --> Agent : tool requests / answer
Agent --> Tools : invoke read-only tool
Tools --> Adapter : request course data
Adapter --> Moodle : REST + student token
Moodle --> DB : internal database queries
note bottom of Claude
Student/course data leaves host here.
No secrets in browser or repository.
end note
@enduml
